<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lankan stock market was closed on Tuesday due to a Buddhist holiday.</p>
<p>On Monday, the Colombo all share index continued to rise ending 26.8 points, or 3.7 percent, higher at 747.8 on turnover of 82.5 million rupees.</p>
<p>Trading resumes on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
